  "instructions": [
    "in a medium saucepan, combine the cornstarch and water, whisking until the cornstarch is fully dissolved",
    "add the sunflower oil, onion, garlic, caraway seeds, salt, and black pepper, and cook over medium heat for 5 minutes",
    "increase the heat to high and bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes",
    "add the chopped fresh dill, apple cider vinegar, and apple juice, and stir to combine",
    "transfer the mixture to a serving dish and garnish with a sprig of fresh parsley",
    "cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld"
